{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-90101","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154081","text":"webhost.systems — Spec v1 (Implementation-Ready Document Set)"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90103","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154082","marks":["bold"],"text":"SUPERSEDED IN PART — the data layer. Added 2026-08-15; the rest of this document stands."},{"id":"spn-154083","text":"  This is a dated design record and has "},{"id":"spn-154084","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-154085","text":" been rewritten: rewriting it would fabricate a design review nobody performed. What it gets wrong is one layer, named here so it can be read around.  "},{"id":"spn-154086","marks":["bold"],"text":"The shared-Supabase route was abandoned by Travis on 2026-07-30"},{"id":"spn-154087","text":", replaced by "},{"id":"spn-154088","marks":["code"],"text":"studbook"},{"id":"spn-154089","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-154090","marks":["code"],"text":"studbook/docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-154091","text":" — a spec with no implementation; do not build from it yet). Anything below that specifies Supabase tables, RLS policies, Supabase Auth or "},{"id":"spn-154092","marks":["code"],"text":"amp.profiles"},{"id":"spn-154093","text":" identity is describing a route that is no longer taken. "},{"id":"spn-154094","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-supabase/"},{"id":"spn-154095","text":" is "},{"id":"spn-154096","marks":["bold"],"text":"archived, not failed"},{"id":"spn-154097","text":" — it still runs, and nothing migrates off it until studbook can hold the same data with the same guarantees.  The blocker is one unruled question — where confidentiality comes from. See "},{"id":"spn-154098","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFIDENTIALITY.md"},{"id":"spn-154099","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-154100","marks":["code"],"text":"THREAT_MODEL.md"},{"id":"spn-154101","text":" in the repository root.  "},{"id":"spn-154102","marks":["bold"],"text":"The product, API, UX and protocol design in this document are unaffected."},{"id":"spn-154103","text":" Read them.  "},{"id":"spn-154104","marks":["code"],"text":"REVISION_REGISTER.md"},{"id":"spn-154105","text":" tracks what else in the tree still contradicts a decision already made."}]}],"id":"blk-90102","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90105","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154106","marks":["bold"],"text":"Also corrected:"},{"id":"spn-154107","text":" this document describes WebHost.Systems as a "},{"id":"spn-154108","marks":["bold"],"text":"Convex"},{"id":"spn-154109","text":" backend. It is not, and never was in this tree — "},{"id":"spn-154110","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/apps/web/package.json"},{"id":"spn-154111","text":" depends on "},{"id":"spn-154112","marks":["code"],"text":"@supabase/supabase-js"},{"id":"spn-154113","text":", with no Convex or Clerk dependency anywhere in the monorepo. The same wrong claim is currently live on "},{"id":"spn-154114","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.systems"},{"id":"spn-154115","text":" and was in "},{"id":"spn-154116","marks":["code"],"text":"AGENTS.md"},{"id":"spn-154117","text":" until 2026-08-15."}]}],"id":"blk-90104","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-90106","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154118","text":"Version: 1.0 Status: Implementation-ready draft Audience: Engineering Last updated: 2026-01-21"}]},{"id":"blk-90107","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154119","text":"This folder is the "},{"id":"spn-154120","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical v1 specification"},{"id":"spn-154121","text":" for implementing webhost.systems from scratch. It consolidates product + technical requirements into a small set of normative documents with ADRs (Architecture Decision Records). If you implement only what’s in these files, you should be able to build a working v1."}]},{"id":"blk-90108","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154122","text":"How to use this spec (recommended reading order)"}]},{"id":"blk-90109","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90111","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154123","marks":["bold"],"text":"Start here (overall system)"}]}],"id":"blk-90110","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-90112","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90114","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154124","marks":["code"],"text":"00_MASTER_SPEC.md"},{"id":"spn-154125","text":" — the single “master” engineering spec: scope, architecture, flows, core requirements, acceptance criteria."}]}],"id":"blk-90113","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90115","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90117","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154126","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement your API surface and contracts"}]}],"id":"blk-90116","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-90118","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90120","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154127","marks":["code"],"text":"10_API_CONTRACTS.md"},{"id":"spn-154128","text":" — normalized request/response shapes, error envelope, idempotency, pagination, invocation gateway, telemetry ingestion, and billing/webhook contracts."}]}],"id":"blk-90119","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90121","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154129","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement runtime portability"}]}],"id":"blk-90122","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-90124","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154130","marks":["code"],"text":"20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"},{"id":"spn-154131","text":" — Runtime Provider Interface (RPI) that all runtimes must implement, plus adapter guidance (including AgentCore TypeScript adapter guidance using "},{"id":"spn-154132","marks":["code"],"text":"@aws-sdk/client-bedrock-agentcore"},{"id":"spn-154133","text":", and notes on the "},{"id":"spn-154134","marks":["code"],"text":"bedrock-agentcore"},{"id":"spn-154135","text":" tools SDK ecosystem)."}]}],"id":"blk-90125","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90127","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90129","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154136","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build your control-plane data layer"}]}],"id":"blk-90128","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-90130","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90132","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154137","marks":["code"],"text":"30_DATA_MODEL_SUPABASE.md"},{"id":"spn-154138","text":" — Supabase/PostgreSQL schema, indexes, invariants, RLS policies, retention and deletion semantics."}]}],"id":"blk-90131","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90133","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90135","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154139","marks":["bold"],"text":"Lock down security and secrets"}]}],"id":"blk-90134","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":5},{"id":"blk-90136","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90138","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154140","marks":["code"],"text":"40_SECURITY_SECRETS_COMPLIANCE.md"},{"id":"spn-154141","text":" — threat model, secrets strategy requirements, telemetry integrity, webhook integrity, artifact safety, acceptance criteria."}]}],"id":"blk-90137","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90139","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90141","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154142","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build metering, billing UX, and enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-90140","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":6},{"id":"blk-90142","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90144","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154143","marks":["code"],"text":"50_OBSERVABILITY_BILLING_LIMITS.md"},{"id":"spn-154144","text":" — telemetry pipeline, aggregation model, cost estimation (estimated in v1), tier entitlements, runtime gating, limit enforcement algorithms."}]}],"id":"blk-90143","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90145","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154145","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify correctness end-to-end"}]}],"id":"blk-90146","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":7},{"id":"blk-90148","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90150","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154146","marks":["code"],"text":"60_TESTING_ACCEPTANCE.md"},{"id":"spn-154147","text":" — unit/integration/E2E test plan + release gates and system-level definition of done."}]}],"id":"blk-90149","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90151","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154148","text":"Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)"}]},{"id":"blk-90152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154149","text":"ADRs document the “why” behind major choices and define additional constraints that implementations must satisfy."}]},{"id":"blk-90153","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90155","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154150","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0001-multi-runtime.md"},{"id":"spn-154151","text":" — Multi-runtime strategy (Cloudflare default + AgentCore premium), explicitly TypeScript-first across both runtimes (AgentCore SDKs: "},{"id":"spn-154152","marks":["code"],"text":"@aws-sdk/client-bedrock-agentcore"},{"id":"spn-154153","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-154154","marks":["code"],"text":"bedrock-agentcore"},{"id":"spn-154155","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-90154","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90157","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154156","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0002-supabase-control-plane.md"},{"id":"spn-154157","text":" — Supabase as control-plane backend (supersedes original Convex choice); Edge Functions for server-only logic."}]}],"id":"blk-90156","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154158","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0003-secrets-strategy.md"},{"id":"spn-154159","text":" — No plaintext secrets in DB; provider-native secret injection; write-only secrets API."}]}],"id":"blk-90158","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154160","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0004-telemetry-integrity.md"},{"id":"spn-154161","text":" — Deployment-scoped signed telemetry events + ownership cross-check."}]}],"id":"blk-90160","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154162","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0005-deployment-immutability.md"},{"id":"spn-154163","text":" — Immutable deployment records + "},{"id":"spn-154164","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-154165","text":" routing pointer + rollback."}]}],"id":"blk-90162","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154166","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0006-invocation-protocol.md"},{"id":"spn-154167","text":" — Canonical "},{"id":"spn-154168","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"},{"id":"spn-154169","text":" protocol, session semantics, and SSE streaming model."}]}],"id":"blk-90164","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90167","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154170","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0007-entitlements-and-limits.md"},{"id":"spn-154171","text":" — Tier entitlements, runtime gating, and limit enforcement strategy."}]}],"id":"blk-90166","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90168","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154172","text":"Progress logs"}]},{"id":"blk-90169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154173","text":"Daily implementation progress logs live in "},{"id":"spn-154174","marks":["code"],"text":"../progress/"},{"id":"spn-154175","text":" (relative to this folder). These logs are "},{"id":"spn-154176","marks":["bold"],"text":"non-normative"},{"id":"spn-154177","text":" and exist to track execution against this spec."}]},{"id":"blk-90170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154178","text":"Recommended convention:"}]},{"id":"blk-90171","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90173","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154179","text":"One file per day: "},{"id":"spn-154180","marks":["code"],"text":"YYYY-MM-DD.md"}]}],"id":"blk-90172","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154181","text":"Include: what shipped, what changed, decisions made (with links to ADRs/spec sections), and next steps."}]}],"id":"blk-90174","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90176","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154182","text":"Normative conventions used in this spec"}]},{"id":"blk-90177","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90179","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154183","marks":["bold"],"text":"MUST / MUST NOT / SHOULD / MAY"},{"id":"spn-154184","text":" are used intentionally."}]}],"id":"blk-90178","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154185","marks":["bold"],"text":"Control plane"},{"id":"spn-154186","text":" = auth, DB, deploy orchestration, billing, telemetry ingestion/aggregation, UI API."}]}],"id":"blk-90180","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154187","marks":["bold"],"text":"Data plane"},{"id":"spn-154188","text":" = runtime provider execution environments (Cloudflare Workers/DO, AWS AgentCore)."}]}],"id":"blk-90182","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90185","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154189","marks":["bold"],"text":"Session IDs"},{"id":"spn-154190","text":" are "},{"id":"spn-154191","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-154192","text":" and runtime-specific; the control plane and clients must not parse them."}]}],"id":"blk-90184","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90187","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154193","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deployments"},{"id":"spn-154194","text":" are "},{"id":"spn-154195","marks":["bold"],"text":"immutable"},{"id":"spn-154196","text":" records; routing is via the agent’s single "},{"id":"spn-154197","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-154198","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-90186","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90188","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154199","text":"Implementation “starter checklist” (quick reference)"}]},{"id":"blk-90189","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154200","text":"Minimum v1 must-haves:"}]},{"id":"blk-90190","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154201","text":"Auth + tenant isolation across all endpoints."}]}],"id":"blk-90191","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154202","text":"Agent CRUD."}]}],"id":"blk-90193","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90196","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154203","text":"Immutable deployments + rollback (active pointer)."}]}],"id":"blk-90195","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90198","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154204","text":"Invocation gateway with consistent "},{"id":"spn-154205","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"},{"id":"spn-154206","text":" contract (non-streaming required; streaming recommended)."}]}],"id":"blk-90197","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90200","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154207","text":"Telemetry ingestion with integrity protection (deployment-scoped signing) and ownership cross-check."}]}],"id":"blk-90199","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90202","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154208","text":"Usage aggregation by billing period + dashboard usage views."}]}],"id":"blk-90201","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90204","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154209","text":"Tier entitlements + runtime gating (AgentCore gated) + at least request-limit enforcement."}]}],"id":"blk-90203","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90206","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154210","text":"No plaintext secrets in the primary DB; secrets injected into providers."}]}],"id":"blk-90205","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154211","text":"Retention for raw telemetry/logs by tier (at minimum: raw telemetry deletion job)."}]}],"id":"blk-90207","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154212","text":"E2E flow: create agent → set secrets → deploy (Cloudflare) → invoke → view usage."}]}],"id":"blk-90209","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90211","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154213","text":"Out of scope (explicit v1 non-goals)"}]},{"id":"blk-90212","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154214","text":"Team/org/role-based access control (single-owner resources only)."}]}],"id":"blk-90213","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90216","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154215","text":"Perfect cost reconciliation with provider billing exports (v1 cost is “estimated”)."}]}],"id":"blk-90215","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154216","text":"Public agents / unauthenticated invocation (unless explicitly added later with API keys)."}]}],"id":"blk-90217","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154217","text":"Full prompt/response storage (telemetry is numeric and metadata-focused by default)."}]}],"id":"blk-90219","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-90221","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154218","text":"Notes on older drafts"}]},{"id":"blk-90222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154219","text":"This folder is the canonical spec. Earlier rough drafts (if any remain) are useful as background, but "},{"id":"spn-154220","marks":["bold"],"text":"implementation should follow this folder"},{"id":"spn-154221","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-90223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154222","text":"If any contradictions are found:"}]},{"id":"blk-90224","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90226","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154223","text":"Prefer "},{"id":"spn-154224","marks":["code"],"text":"00_MASTER_SPEC.md"},{"id":"spn-154225","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-154226","marks":["code"],"text":"10_API_CONTRACTS.md"},{"id":"spn-154227","text":" for canonical behavior."}]}],"id":"blk-90225","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154228","text":"Prefer ADRs for “why” and invariants."}]}],"id":"blk-90227","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-90230","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154229","text":"Treat earlier drafts as non-normative."}]}],"id":"blk-90229","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-90231","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-154230","text":"PULSE Loop Manifest"}]},{"id":"blk-90232","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154231","text":"WebHost.Systems is a "},{"id":"spn-154232","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE-conforming loop"},{"id":"spn-154233","text":" under OS-010. As the hosting layer for the entire [&] ecosystem, its loop encodes the "},{"id":"spn-154234","marks":["bold"],"text":"deploy → invoke → meter → bill"},{"id":"spn-154235","text":" rhythm. Unlike other loops in the portfolio it is the only one whose substrates include both Cloudflare Workers and AWS AgentCore (per ADR-0001), and its "},{"id":"spn-154236","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-154237","text":" phase is intentionally pluggable through the Runtime Provider Interface (per "},{"id":"spn-154238","marks":["code"],"text":"20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"},{"id":"spn-154239","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-90233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154240","marks":["bold"],"text":"Loop ID:"},{"id":"spn-154241","text":" "},{"id":"spn-154242","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.deploy_invoke"},{"id":"spn-154243","text":" "},{"id":"spn-154244","marks":["bold"],"text":"Loop name:"},{"id":"spn-154245","text":" WebHost.Systems Deploy/Invoke Loop "},{"id":"spn-154246","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-154247","text":" 1.0.0 "},{"id":"spn-154248","marks":["bold"],"text":"Owner:"},{"id":"spn-154249","text":" webhost.systems "},{"id":"spn-154250","marks":["bold"],"text":"Workspace scope:"},{"id":"spn-154251","text":" required"}]},{"id":"blk-90234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-154252","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phases (5 canonical kinds):"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-90236","spans":[{"id":"spn-154253","text":"Phase ID"}]},{"id":"blk-90237","spans":[{"id":"spn-154254","text":"Kind"}]},{"id":"blk-90238","spans":[{"id":"spn-154255","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-90235","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-90239","spans":[{"id":"spn-154256","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_deployment"}]},{"id":"blk-90240","spans":[{"id":"spn-154257","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"}]},{"id":"blk-90241","spans":[{"id":"spn-154258","text":"Resolve "},{"id":"spn-154259","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_id → activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-154260","text":" from Supabase control plane (per ADR-0005)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-90242","spans":[{"id":"spn-154261","marks":["code"],"text":"route_runtime"}]},{"id":"blk-90243","spans":[{"id":"spn-154262","marks":["code"],"text":"route"}]},{"id":"blk-90244","spans":[{"id":"spn-154263","text":"Select runtime provider via RPI (Cloudflare default, AgentCore premium, others as adapters)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-90245","spans":[{"id":"spn-154264","marks":["code"],"text":"act_invoke"}]},{"id":"blk-90246","spans":[{"id":"spn-154265","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-90247","spans":[{"id":"spn-154266","text":"Execute "},{"id":"spn-154267","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"},{"id":"spn-154268","text":" (per ADR-0006); stream SSE response if requested; capture telemetry"}]}],[{"id":"blk-90248","spans":[{"id":"spn-154269","marks":["code"],"text":"learn_telemetry"}]},{"id":"blk-90249","spans":[{"id":"spn-154270","marks":["code"],"